<p begin="25.835" end="27.600" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="25.835" end="26.052">You&apos;ll</span> <span begin="26.052" end="26.269">see</span> <span begin="26.269" end="26.497">the</span> <span begin="26.497" end="26.723">wri</span><span begin="26.723" end="26.960">ting</span> <span begin="26.960" end="27.175">on</span> <span begin="27.175" end="27.395">the</span> <span begin="27.395" end="27.600">wall</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你会看见墙上的预言</span></p><p begin="27.600" end="29.150" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="27.600" end="27.845">I</span> <span begin="27.845" end="28.060">took</span> <span begin="28.060" end="28.291">it</span> <span begin="28.291" end="28.697">too</span> <span begin="28.697" end="29.150">far</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我做得太过火</span></p><p begin="29.382" end="31.130" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="29.382" end="29.620">And</span> <span begin="29.620" end="29.832">I</span> <span begin="29.832" end="30.057">could</span> <span begin="30.057" end="30.259">ne</span><span begin="30.259" end="30.480">ver</span> <span begin="30.480" end="30.675">get</span> <span begin="30.675" end="30.917">e</span><span begin="30.917" end="31.130">nough</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">而我永远贪得无厌</span></p><p begin="31.130" end="32.669" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="31.130" end="31.372">I</span> <span begin="31.372" end="31.572">did</span> <span begin="31.572" end="31.807">a</span> <span begin="31.807" end="32.239">good</span> <span begin="32.239" end="32.669">job</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我做的很完美</span></p><p begin="32.905" end="34.902" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="32.905" end="33.132">And</span> <span begin="33.132" end="33.329">now</span> <span begin="33.329" end="33.569">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="33.569" end="33.801">fi</span><span begin="33.801" end="33.905">nal</span><span begin="33.905" end="34.019">ly</span> <span begin="34.019" end="34.225">out</span> <span begin="34.225" end="34.461">of</span><span begin="34.461" end="34.902">—</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">现在我终于耗尽了——</span></p><p begin="34.902" end="36.194" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="34.902" end="35.117">I&apos;ve</span> <span begin="35.117" end="35.336">been</span> <span begin="35.336" end="35.549">e</span><span begin="35.549" end="35.769">very</span><span begin="35.769" end="36.194">where</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我曾去到过每一个地方</span></p><p begin="36.419" end="38.172" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="36.419" end="36.652">Through</span> <span begin="36.652" end="36.870">e</span><span begin="36.870" end="37.101">very</span> <span begin="37.101" end="37.318">un</span><span begin="37.318" end="37.542">de</span><span begin="37.542" end="37.949">fended</span> <span begin="37.949" end="38.172">door</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">穿过每一扇不设防的门</span></p><p begin="38.172" end="39.684" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="38.172" end="38.414">You&apos;ll</span> <span begin="38.414" end="38.609">know</span> <span begin="38.609" end="38.837">that</span> <span begin="38.837" end="39.044">I</span> <span begin="39.044" end="39.267">was</span> <span begin="39.267" end="39.684">there</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你会知道我也曾在那里</span></p><p begin="39.931" end="41.717" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="39.931" end="40.166">You&apos;ll</span> <span begin="40.166" end="40.379">see</span> <span begin="40.379" end="40.599">the</span> <span begin="40.599" end="40.818">wri</span><span begin="40.818" end="41.044">ting</span> <span begin="41.044" end="41.269">on</span> <span begin="41.269" end="41.491">the</span> <span begin="41.491" end="41.717">wall</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你会看见墙上的预言</span></p><p begin="41.717" end="43.261" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span beg