:lang="zh-CN">终于运气耗尽</span></span></p><p begin="1:04.272" end="1:05.350" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:04.272" end="1:04.490">I&apos;ve</span> <span begin="1:04.490" end="1:04.702">got</span> <span begin="1:04.702" end="1:04.912">a</span> <span begin="1:04.912" end="1:05.350">charm</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我有一个护身符</span></p><p begin="1:05.545" end="1:09.188" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:05.545" end="1:05.764">I</span> <span begin="1:05.764" end="1:05.990">wan</span><span begin="1:05.990" end="1:06.224">na</span> <span begin="1:06.224" end="1:06.435">put</span> <span begin="1:06.435" end="1:06.657">it</span> <span begin="1:06.657" end="1:07.109">on</span> <span begin="1:07.109" end="1:07.522">your</span> <span begin="1:07.522" end="1:08.704">heart,</span> <span begin="1:08.704" end="1:09.188">yeah</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我想把它戴在你的心上</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="1:08.900" end="1:10.920"><span begin="1:08.900" end="1:09.104">(Fi</span><span begin="1:09.104" end="1:09.319">nal</span><span begin="1:09.319" end="1:09.575">ly</span> <span begin="1:09.765" end="1:10.203">out</span> <span begin="1:10.203" end="1:10.422">of</span> <span begin="1:10.422" end="1:10.920">luck)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">终于运气耗尽</span></span></p><p begin="1:11.303" end="1:12.425" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:11.303" end="1:11.515">I</span> <span begin="1:11.515" end="1:11.738">wan</span><span begin="1:11.738" end="1:11.955">na</span> <span begin="1:11.955" end="1:12.425">cry</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我想要哭泣</span></p><p begin="1:12.625" end="1:16.241" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:12.625" end="1:12.853">I</span> <span begin="1:12.853" end="1:13.053">wan</span><span begin="1:13.053" end="1:13.293">na</span> <span begin="1:13.293" end="1:13.495">mul</span><span begin="1:13.495" end="1:13.725">ti</span><span begin="