:25.424" end="1:26.534" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:25.424" end="1:25.645">I</span> <span begin="1:25.645" end="1:25.857">wan</span><span begin="1:25.857" end="1:26.069">na</span> <span begin="1:26.069" end="1:26.534">cry</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我想要哭泣</span></p><p begin="1:26.734" end="1:30.371" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:26.734" end="1:26.964">I</span> <span begin="1:26.964" end="1:27.182">wan</span><span begin="1:27.182" end="1:27.409">na</span> <span begin="1:27.409" end="1:27.634">mul</span><span begin="1:27.634" end="1:27.854">ti</span><span begin="1:27.854" end="1:28.298">ply</span> <span begin="1:28.298" end="1:28.753">more</span> <span begin="1:28.753" end="1:29.848">times,</span> <span begin="1:29.848" end="1:30.371">yeah</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我想无数次地重演</span></p><p begin="1:45.258" end="1:46.614" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:45.258" end="1:45.469">And</span> <span begin="1:45.469" end="1:45.711">it&apos;s</span> <span begin="1:45.711" end="1:45.939">a</span> <span begin="1:45.939" end="1:46.405">mes</span><span begin="1:46.405" end="1:46.614">sage</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">这是一条讯息</span></p><p begin="1:46.614" end="1:48.192" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:46.614" end="1:46.829">I</span> <span begin="1:46.829" end="1:47.055">know</span> <span begin="1:47.055" end="1:47.284">what</span> <span begin="1:47.284" end="1:47.486">you</span> <span begin="1:47.486" end="1:48.192">are</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我了解你的本质</span></p><p begin="1:48.375" end="1:50.114" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:48.375" end="1:48.603">I&apos;ve</span> <span begin="1:48.603" end="1:48.814">al</span><span begin="1:48.814" end="1:49.045">rea</span><span begin="1:49.045" end="1:49.256">dy</span> <span begin="1:49.256" end="1:49.676">been</span> <span begin="1:49.676" end="1:50.114">there</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我早就经历过这一切</span></p><p begin="1:50.114" end="1:51.804" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:50.114" end="1:50.182">And</span> <span begin="1:50.182" end="1:50.309">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="1:50.309" end="1:50.574">al</span><span begin="1:50.574" end="1:50.816">rea</span><span begin="1:50.816" end="1:51.024">dy</span> <span begin="1:51.024" end="1:51.804">gone</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">而我已离去</span></p><p begin="1:52.344" end="1:53.644" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:52.344" end="1:52.577">And</span> <span begin="1:52.577" end="1:52.783">it&apos;s</span> <span begin="1:52.783" end="1:53.001">a</span> <span begin="1:53.001" end="1:53.429">les</span><span begin="1:53.429" end="1:53.644">son</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">这是一场教训</span></p><p begin="1:53.644" end="1:55.199" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:53.644" end="1:53.879">You</span> <span begin="1:53.879" end="1:54.101">bot</span><span begin="1:54.101" end="1:54.331">tle</span> <span begin="1:54.331" end="1:54.541">it</span> <span begin="1:54.541" end="1:55.199">up</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你将情绪深锁心头</span></p><p begin="1:55.431" end="1:56.994" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:55.431" end="1:55.631">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="1:55.631" end="1:55.856">sel</span><span begin="1:55.856" end="1:56.096">ling</span> <span begin="1:56.096" end="1:56.313">your</span> <span begin="1:56.313" end="1:56.737">skin</span> <span begin="1:56.737" end="1:56.994">out</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我正出卖你的伪装</span></p><p begin="1:56.994" end="1:58.721" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:56.994" end="1:57.189">And</span> <span begin="1:57.189" end="1:57.429">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="1:57.429" end="1:57.639">gi</span><span begin="1:57.639" end="1:57.864">ving</span> <span begin="1:57.864" end="1:58.079">you</spa